OL,3,GNEWSAMan who treated city as 'dumping
OL,4,Aground' sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who treated a city "like his own
OL,7,Fpersonal dumping ground" has been
OL,8,Fsentenced after his crimes were exposed
OL,9,Fby dashcam videos.
OL,11,FJohn Sheridan of Park Royal in London
OL,12,Freceived a 30-week jail sentence
OL,13,Fsuspended for two years after dumping
OL,14,Fwaste, including a bath, carpets and a
OL,15,Ffridge freezer, at locations across
OL,16,FGloucester.
OL,18,FGloucester City Council said it brought
OL,19,FSheridan, 42, before court after video
OL,20,Fevidence was submitted by the public,
OL,21,Fand he pleaded guilty to all five
OL,22,Foffences of knowingly depositing waste.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
