OL,3,GNEWSAMan who treated city as 'dumping
OL,4,Aground' sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Jeremy Hilton, council
OL,7,Fleader, said the case "highlights the
OL,8,Fvital role residents can play in
OL,9,Ftackling environmental crime".
